				Time="2011-05-31T02:17:47" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>初回話しかけ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="mizuguchi_mai:W00226"
				Time="2011-05-31T02:17:53" />
		</CommentCell>
		<ExtraCell
